---
title: Pattern Match
description: Answers graded by regular expression, so one pattern covers a whole family of correct responses.
category: formats
tags: [regex, typing]
:reveal_answers=after_every_question
:points_correct=2
---

type_pattern: Give any year in the 1990s.
{
=199[0-9]
~19[0-8][0-9]
}

type_pattern: Write a UK postcode-shaped string, e.g. SW1A 1AA.
{
=[A-Z]{1,2}[0-9][A-Z0-9]? ?[0-9][A-Z]{2}
}
:match_case=true

type_pattern: What is the chemical formula for water?
!<reveal>[Need a nudge?](Two hydrogens, one oxygen.) %-1%
{
=H2O
=H₂O
~HO2 %-1%
}

type_pattern: Give a decimal number between 0 and 1.
{
=0\.[0-9]+
~[01]
}
